"P3816035807" "Future Threat"
// requiresfailedtext :
"P2251523409" "You must be a member of the Midnighter Club to access this mission."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - MaltaBaseLocationClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3579626482" "Location of secret Malta base"
// DetailString :
"P2154860675" "One of the Nemesis soldiers you questioned revealed the location of a secret Malta base on Peregrine Island. The soldier didn't know what went on in the base, but that should be easy for you to figure out with a little personal attention to the matter."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - InvasionPlanClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2916381120" "Invasion Plans"
// DetailString :
"P1738410887" "These computer files describe a detailed plan for invading Cimerora! The Malta Group plans to use an experimental temporal flux device to create a rift through time that will enable them to send a large group of operatives back to Cimerora. While they won't be in communication with this invasion force, the Malta leadership is certain their forces will be sufficient to <color orange>'contain the Cimerora threat before it becomes a problem in our time.'</color><br><br>The rest of the file is filled with technical information on the temporal flux device. You think Daedalus should be able to make good use of the technical specifications."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - PowerSupplySchematic 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2650332229" "Fabrication Schematic"
// DetailString :
"P2319477993" "You have obtained the schematic for the experimental power supply Daedalus needs for his machine. With the proper parts and access to a Crey Energy Fabricator Mk I, you should be able to manufacture the power supply. "

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - PowerSupplyClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2005528787" "Experimental Power Supply"
// DetailString :
"P2340160816" "You have fabricated the experimental power supply Daedalus request to help stop the Malta Group's planned temporal invasion of Cimerora. You should get it to him as soon as possible."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - FutureThreat1Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P935780374" "Future Threat"
// DetailString :
"P3964405167" "It all started when Daedalus detected some strange energy readings coming from the future. He asked you to go to Peregrine Island and talk to your contacts to see what the Malta Group was up to. Vigorous street investigations revealed the location of a secret Malta base. You busted into the base, defeated its commander, and found the Malta Group's plans for an invasion of Cimerora."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - FutureThreat2Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P3326066537" "It all started when Daedalus detected some strange energy readings coming from the future. He asked you to go to Peregrine Island and talk to your contacts to see what the Malta Group was up to. Vigorous street investigations revealed the location of a secret Malta base. You busted into the base, defeated its commander, and found the Malta Group's plans for an invasion of Cimerora.<br><br>You and Cimerora's legendary craftsman quickly devised a plan to protect the Peninsula from invasion. Daedalus went off to craft a machine that would shield his homeland from the temporal invasion while you traveled to Peregrine Island to visit a Crey Industries facility. There, you recovered a fabrication schematic and some materials and used an experimental automated fabrication device to construct a high-intensity power supply to act as the core of Daedalus' shielding device. As you handed it over to your crafty friend, you hope it would be enough to do the job."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - FutureThreat1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P1579230347" "Broken Malta Group helmet"
// tDetailString :
"P1732051736" "This shattered combat helmet, recovered from the battlefield, is a reminder of the incident you've come to call:<br><br><color deepskyblue>Future Threat</color><br><br>It all started when Daedalus, the legendary craftsman of Cimerora, detected strange energy readings coming from the future. You traveled to Peregrine Island to investigate the energy and found that the Malta Group was planning an invasion through time of Cimerora.<br><br>Daedalus proposed building an energy shielding device to stop this invasion, but he need your help in doing so. You returned to Peregrine Island and found a secret Crey Industries laboratory facility, which you used to fabricate an experimental power source for Daedalus' new device. You returned to Cimerora just in time to defeat the initial Malta invading force, buying Daedalus the time he needed to complete his device.<br><br>Because of your help, Cimerora remains free from Malta's control. It's all part of a good day's work!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1119014825" "Are you here for a situation report, {HeroName}, or do you have something else on your mind?"
// Answer Text :
"P380480927" "Ask for a situation report"
// Answer Text :
"P2828041174" "Ask about the Malta Group"
// Answer Text :
"P1318281838" "Ask about something else"
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page Situation1 Text :
"P3036742416" "The situation is quiet, {HeroName}. Almost too quiet. It's like the Malta Group has gone silent. They're losing ground to Nemesis, who's starting to encroach on their operation."
// Answer Text :
"P543184435" "Ask for more information on the Malta group"
// Page MaltaPage1 Text :
"P4109839402" "I don't have any hard data, but I think Malta's up to something big. They've been too quiet. If you want to find out what they're doing and stop it, that would be a positive action. <color orange>You can start by shaking some information out of those</color> <color red>Nemesis</color> <color orange>clowns</color>. They've been pushing in on some of Malta's ops, and might have information on where Malta's been hiding out.<br><br>Start there and see where it leads you. Good luck, {HeroName}. Let me know what you find out."
// Page ExitPage1 Text :
"P3578345607" "I don't have anything else for you, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1127693933" "{HeroName}, you have come at the right time, for once again I must impose on your good nature and heroic spirit. During a recent experiment, one of my devices picked up strange energies. After some study, I was able to track the source of these energies. The trail lead straight to your time... <color orange>to the future.</color><br><br>Those you call the Malta Group have cast a covetous eye on Cimerora. Whatever their fell plan is, it must not come to pass.<br><br>I fear I was not able to trace this energy source to a precise location, but I did learn enough to know that these future foes are operating out of your own Paragon City, in a place you call Peregrine Island. <color orange>I would ask you to travel there and check your sources for any information they may have on this planned incursion.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P2952001955" "Go to Peregrine Island and investigate the Malta Group's activities"
// SendOffString :
"P1065803073" "Thank you, {HeroName}. It pains me to have to ask for your aid each time we talk, but, as you know, I cannot travel to the future myself, as I am not attuned to the crystal you use. Pray see what you can find out what the Malta operatives know and investigate any information you find."
// TaskTitle :
"P530132160" "<color deepskyblue>Future Threat</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2770291627" "<color deepskyblue>Part One</color>"

