"P533939033" "You have the goods on what the Malta Group is up to. It's time to return and talk to Daedalus to see what the two of you can figure out to drop a monkey wrench in their plans."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2444685939" "My suspicions were correct, {HeroName}. This Malta group is planning a strike against sweet Cimerora. They intend an invasion through <color orange>time itself!</color> <br><br>I shall study this information on their device; I believe I can see the pattern they weave with it. Perhaps, with a little time, I will be able to create a counter to unravel their workings.<br><br>No doubt such an undertaking will require your efforts, so please speak with me again soon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3126966628" "You have accessed the <color red>Crey Energy Fabricator Mk I</color>. Please note that unauthorized use of this machine will result in your termination.<br><br>Please input item schematic and required materials and then press the <color green>START<color> button to initiate the fabrication process."
// Answer Text :
"P2669729841" "Press the START button."
// Page NoObjective Text :
"P1123199067" "<color orange>Warning!</color> You must provide the schematic and appropriate materials to use this fabrication device. Ending session."
// Page NoParts Text :
"P1636873170" "Warning!</color> You must provide all required materials in addition to the schematic to use this fabrication device. Ending session."
// Page NoSchematic Text :
"P3813993172" "Warning!</color> You must provide the appropriate schematic in addition to the required materials to use this fabrication device. Ending session."
// Page Success Text :
"P723011964" "Schematic and materials deposited. Thank you!<br><br>Initiating testing sequence. Do <color red>NOT</color> power down this machine or remove the schematic during this process.<br><br>Schematic integrity check ... <color green>passed.</color><br><br>Parts inventory ... Required parts <color green>available.</color><br><br>Initiating fabrication process.<br><br><color green>Process complete!</color> Have a nice day!"
// Page Done Text :
"P3101191796" "<color orange>Warning!</color> You must provide the schematic and appropriate parts to use this fabrication device. Ending session."
// Page Fallback Text :
"P1283285847" "Warning!</color> This machine is off-line.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P637765099" "The information you gave me is fascinating, {HeroName}! The people from your time can use Lady Science to do so much... so much, yet they still seek to pervert her for their own nefarious ends. But we have a chance to restore the Lady's honor and use her good offices to prevent these villains from achieving their goal.<br><br>My analysis of the Malta Group's plan has revealed a flaw. The method of travel they intend to use to move their forces through time employs a specific frequency of energy. If we shield Cimerora from that form of energy, Malta will not be able to send its troops here and we will be safe.<br><br>To build this shield will require both of our efforts. I must ask you once again to return to Peregrine Island. The files you gave me contained the location of a Crey Industries warehouse that contains the plans and the parts needed to craft the power supply I need to power the machine I have designed to produce this shield.<br><br><color orange>Will you go to Peregrine Island for me?</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P3918658330" "Travel to Peregrine Island and obtain the power supply."
// SendOffString :
"P1625702577" "Thank you, {HeroName}. You are a noble {Hero.gender=male man|lady} indeed. Once you have recovered the plans, you must use a machine you will find there to assemble the parts. That will manufacture the power supply. Please bring it to me as soon as possible, for I fear that Malta will begin to test its time travel device soon."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P160611990" "Create a power supply for Daedalus"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P236707176" "{HeroName}, I beg you. Please bring me the power supply as soon as you can!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P437020894" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two</color>"

