"P175559069" "This force must be defeated, but if I divert my efforts from my crafting I will be unable to complete the shielding device.<br><br><Color orange>Please, {HeroName}, for the love of Cimerora, go to the battlefield and stand against these invaders.</color><br><br>Your valiant efforts on the battlefield will allow me to finish my temporal shield. Through your might and my craft we will make a two-pronged strike against the Malta Group and end their threat to Cimerora forever!"
