// Dialog :
"P1360211931" "At last, the battlefield is quiet. You've defeated the Malta Group's scouting force. It's time to check in with Daedalus."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3003660160" "While you were facing the Malta forces on the field of battle, I completed my shielding device. Now that it is active, these would-be invaders will not have access to sweet Cimerora.<br><br>I am now free to concentrate on aiding my liege in dealing with this land's own problems, without any interference from outside forces. I thank you, {HeroName}. Not only are you a true friend to this humble crafter, you are a true friend to this land. Know that you are always welcome here."

